title: changes to a graphnode's text
pid: 6453e671-8ed4-4ff1-b9d0-d7beffb20f9e
body: |2-
  The graphnode might be represented by a write-protected leaf,
  in which case its body is not shown.
  Therefore an "its text was changed" viewchild
  should contain two children "old" and "new":
  #+begin_example
    * <a graphnode>
    ** "its text changed"
    *** "old" <old title>
    <old body>
    *** "new" <new title>
    <new body>
  #+end_example
  The text in quotations shows in a system font.
